    "body": "react-redux-router\r\nIt breaks the forward navigation in case history.index < history.length - 1. Basically, in case the user clicked on back, filled a form and did not submit, clicked on back and the router stopped the navigation by pushing the form entry again. The forward navigation is lost.",
