    "updated_at": "2021-02-02T18:18:34Z",
    "body": "Chromium is interested in solving this use case, as part of a larger overhaul of the history API to make it more suitable for single-page applications. Take a look, and feel free to comment with support, in https://github.com/WICG/proposals/issues/20. In particular, the [navigation monitoring and interception](https://github.com/slightlyoff/history_api/blob/master/app_history.md#navigation-monitoring-and-interception) section touches on this.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
